WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.829
The world is now 
 one big small town.

00:00:04.961 --> 00:00:07.073
But within&nbsp;that 
virtual town square,

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:09.101
there are tiers 
of relationships,

00:00:09.101 --> 00:00:11.364
degrees of intimacy,

00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:14.352
and everyone&nbsp;deserves a 
different amount of you,

00:00:14.888 --> 00:00:16.610
a different side.

00:00:17.571 --> 00:00:19.970
Now, where those 
boundaries lie

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.500
is up&nbsp;to you.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.563
I try to wait 48 hours 
before posting and sharing 

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.154
because that way I 
can be present

00:00:28.154 --> 00:00:30.118
in&nbsp;private with 
the people I love

00:00:30.118 --> 00:00:32.246
before calculating 
how I'm going to

00:00:32.246 --> 00:00:33.806
publicly position it.

00:00:34.271 --> 00:00:36.000
And post&nbsp;with purpose.

00:00:36.676 --> 00:00:39.037
Before I share, I 
ask myself: Why?

00:00:39.037 --> 00:00:41.549
What's the purpose? 
And most importantly,

00:00:41.549 --> 00:00:45.190
how does&nbsp;it serve 
the people I love?

00:00:45.918 --> 00:00:48.949
Because cultivating a 
private life is precious.

00:00:49.586 --> 00:00:51.284
It's sacred.

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:56.641
Its&nbsp;value is inherent in 
what you don't share.

